<div class="min-h-screen bg-[#f5f4f7] font-sans text-slate-900">
  <header class="bg-white shadow-[0_3px_10px_rgba(15,23,42,0.18)]">
    <div class="mx-auto flex min-h-[82px] max-w-[1140px] flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3 sm:px-6 lg:flex-nowrap lg:px-0">
      <%= link_to root_path, class: "flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2.5 no-underline" do %>
        <span class="h-9 w-9 rounded-full bg-[#07349e] sm:h-10 sm:w-10" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="flex flex-col text-slate-900">
          <strong class="text-[16px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-[18px]">Barangay Kalikid Sur</strong>
          <small class="mt-0.5 text-[8px] text-slate-600 sm:text-[9px]">Digital System for Registered Residents</small>
        </span>
      <% end %>

      <nav class="flex w-full flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-[#eff3ff] p-1 text-[11px] font-medium sm:gap-2 lg:w-auto lg:min-w-[600px] lg:justify-between lg:px-5" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <%= link_to "Home", root_path, class: "rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-slate-800 hover:bg-white" %>
        <%= link_to "Requests (Kahilingan)", select_document_type_path, class: "rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-slate-800 hover:bg-white" %>
        <%= link_to "Reports (Sumbong)", barangay_concerns_path, class: "rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-slate-800 hover:bg-white" %>
        <% if current_user.profile.present? %>
          <%= link_to "Profile", profile_path, class: "rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-slate-800 hover:bg-white" %>
        <% else %>
          <%= link_to "Profile", new_profile_path, class: "rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-slate-800 hover:bg-white" %>
        <% end %>
        <% if current_user.barangay_staff? %>
          <%= link_to "Admin", admin_dashboard_path, class: "rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-slate-800 hover:bg-white" %>
        <% end %>
        <%= link_to "Log out", destroy_user_session_path, data: { turbo_method: :delete }, class: "rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-slate-800 hover:bg-white" %>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1140px] space-y-4 px-4 py-5 sm:px-6 sm:py-6 lg:px-0">
    <section class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-lg bg-white p-4 shadow-sm sm:p-5 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between" aria-labelledby="welcome-title">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <p class="mb-2 inline-flex max-w-full items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-[#d8ffef] px-2.5 py-1 text-[9px] font-semibold text-emerald-800">
          <span aria-hidden="true">●</span> 
          <% if current_user.profile.present? && current_user.address.present? %>
            VERIFIED RESIDENT
          <% else %>
            RESIDENT ACCOUNT
          <% end %>
          <% if current_user.address.purok.present? %>
           ● <%= current_user.address.purok %>
          <% end %>
          <span class="uppercase"><%= current_user.address.barangay %></span>
        </p>
        <h1 id="welcome-title" class="text-[23px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#07349e] sm:text-[27px]">Welcome back, <%= current_user.profile.first_name %>!</h1>
        <p class="mt-1 max-w-[630px] text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Maligayang Pagdating sa inyong digital civic desk. Subaybayan ang inyong mga kahilingan at sumbong sa mabilis at tapat na serbisyo publiko.</p>
        <% unless current_user.profile.present? && current_user.address.present? %>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-amber-800">Complete your resident information to access all services. <%= link_to "Continue registration", current_user.profile.present? ? edit_profile_path : new_profile_path, class: "font-semibold underline" %></p>
        <% end %>
      </div>

      <dl class="grid w-full shrink-0 grid-cols-3 gap-1 rounded-lg bg-[#eff3ff] p-1.5 text-center lg:w-[300px]">
        <div class="rounded-md bg-white px-2 py-2"><dt class="text-[8px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-600">Active<br>Requests</dt><dd class="text-[24px] font-bold leading-tight text-[#07349e]"><%= format("%02d", @active_requests) %></dd><dd class="text-[8px] text-slate-500">Request</dd></div>
        <div class="rounded-md bg-white px-2 py-2"><dt class="text-[8px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-600">Active<br>Reports</dt><dd class="text-[24px] font-bold leading-tight text-slate-900"><%= format("%02d", @active_reports) %></dd><dd class="text-[8px] text-slate-500">Concern</dd></div>
        <div class="rounded-md bg-white px-2 py-2"><dt class="text-[8px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-600">Completed</dt><dd class="text-[24px] font-bold leading-tight text-emerald-700"><%= format("%02d", @completed_records) %></dd><dd class="text-[8px] text-slate-500">Accomplished</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2" aria-label="Resident services">
      <article class="flex min-h-[230px] flex-col rounded-lg border-l-4 border-[#07349e] bg-white p-4 shadow-sm sm:p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-[#e1e8ff] px-2 py-1 text-[8px] font-bold text-[#07349e]">▣ SERBISYO NG DOKUMENTASYON</span>
          <span class="text-[9px] text-slate-500">Processing: 1-2 Working Days</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-[19px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#07349e]">Request a Document</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-slate-600">Humiling ng Opisyal na Dokumento o Sertipikasyon</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Secure digitally authenticated barangay issuances compliant with local civic ordinances. Seamless request submission, automated records verification, and counter pickup scheduling.</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-3 gap-y-1 rounded-md bg-[#eff3ff] p-3 text-[9px] sm:grid-cols-2">
          <li>✓ Barangay Clearance</li><li>✓ Certificate of Residency</li><li>✓ Certificate of Indigency</li><li>✓ Barangay Business Endorsement</li>
        </ul>
        <%= link_to "Start New Request  →", select_document_type_path, class: "mt-4 self-end rounded-md bg-[#07349e] px-5 py-2.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-white no-underline hover:bg-[#0b2e83]" %>
      </article>

      <article class="flex min-h-[230px] flex-col rounded-lg border-l-4 border-emerald-700 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm sm:p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-[#d8ffef] px-2 py-1 text-[8px] font-bold text-emerald-800">◉ AKSYON BARANGAY INCIDENT DESK</span>
          <span class="text-[9px] text-slate-500">Tanod / Maintenance Dispatch</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-[19px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-emerald-700">Report a Concern</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-slate-600">Mag-ulat ng Sumbong o Suliranin sa Komunidad</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Directly escalate community infrastructure and sanitation issues. Upload site photographs, tag exact street locations, and receive direct dispatcher logs from our Lupon Tagapamayapa and Tanod brigades.</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-3 gap-y-1 rounded-md bg-[#eff3ff] p-3 text-[9px] sm:grid-cols-2">
          <li>⌖ Broken Streetlights</li><li>⌂ Clogged Drainage &amp; Floods</li><li>♧ Uncollected Waste &amp; Dumps</li><li>♧ Road Hazards &amp; Obstructions</li>
        </ul>
        <%= link_to "File a Concern  →", new_barangay_concern_path, class: "mt-4 self-end rounded-md bg-emerald-700 px-5 py-2.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-white no-underline hover:bg-emerald-800" %>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-lg bg-white p-4 shadow-sm sm:p-5" aria-labelledby="recent-title">
      <div class="mb-4 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
        <div>
          <h2 id="recent-title" class="text-[18px] font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-[20px]">🔹My Recent Requests &amp; Reports</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-[10px] text-slate-600">Mga Kasalukuyang Kahilingan at Sumbong na nasa ilalim pa ng pagsasuri o handa nang kunin.</p>
        </div>
        <% active_filter = params[:filter] || "all" %>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 text-[9px] mb-4">
          <%= link_to root_path(filter: "all"), 
                class: "rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 font-semibold no-underline transition #{active_filter == "all" ? 'bg-[#eff3ff] text-[#07349e]' : 'bg-[#f5f7fc] text-slate-700 hover:bg-[#e7edff]'}" do %>
            All Records (<%= @document_requests.size + @barangay_concerns.size %>)
          <% end %>

          <%= link_to root_path(filter: "documents"), 
                class: "rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 font-semibold no-underline transition #{active_filter == "documents" ? 'bg-[#eff3ff] text-[#07349e]' : 'bg-[#f5f7fc] text-slate-700 hover:bg-[#e7edff]'}" do %>
            Documents (<%= @document_requests.size %>)
          <% end %>

          <%= link_to root_path(filter: "concerns"), 
                class: "rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 font-semibold no-underline transition #{active_filter == "concerns" ? 'bg-[#eff3ff] text-[#07349e]' : 'bg-[#f5f7fc] text-slate-700 hover:bg-[#e7edff]'}" do %>
            Reports (<%= @barangay_concerns.size %>)
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <% if @recent_records.any? %>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full min-w-[680px] border-collapse text-left">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-[#eff3ff] text-[8px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-600">
                <th class="px-3 py-3">Tracking Ref Number</th>
                <th class="px-3 py-3">Service / Concern Type</th>
                <th class="px-3 py-3">Date Filed</th>
                <th class="px-3 py-3">Current Status</th>
                <th class="px-3 py-3">Action</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="text-[10px]">
              <% @recent_records.each do |record| %>
                <% is_request = record.is_a?(DocumentRequest) %>
                <% status_label = record.status.humanize %>
                
                <%# Dynamic badge coloration engine mapped safely to match layout styling classes %>
                <% status_color = is_request ? (record.ready_to_pickup? ? "bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-900" : record.rejected? ? "bg-red-100 text-red-800" : "bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-900") : (record.resolved? ? "bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-900" : record.unactionable? ? "bg-red-100 text-red-800" : "bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-900") %>
                
                <tr class="border-b border-slate-100 last:border-0 hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition">
                  
                  <td class="px-3 py-3 font-semibold text-[#07349e]">
                    <% tracking_token = is_request ? (record.tracking_number.presence || "REQ-#{record.id}") : (record.tracking_number.presence || "BRGY-#{record.id}") %>
                    <%= link_to tracking_token, (is_request ? document_request_path(record) : barangay_concern_path(record)), class: "no-underline hover:underline" %>
                  </td>
                  
                  <td class="px-3 py-3">
                    <span class="block font-medium"><%= is_request ? record.document_type.humanize : record.category.humanize %></span>
                    <span class="mt-0.5 block max-w-[250px] text-[9px] text-slate-500">
                      <%= is_request ? "Purpose: #{truncate(record.purpose, length: 68)}" : truncate(record.reason, length: 68) %>
                    </span>
                  </td>
                  
                  <td class="px-3 py-3">
                    <%= record.created_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
                    <span class="mt-0.5 block text-[9px] text-slate-500"><%= record.created_at.strftime("%I:%M %p") %></span>
                  </td>
                  
                  <td class="px-3 py-3">
                    <span class="inline-flex rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-[8px] font-bold <%= status_color %>">
                      ● <%= status_label.upcase %>
                    </span>
                  </td>
                  
                  <td class="px-3 py-3">
                    <%= link_to "View", (is_request ? document_request_path(record) : barangay_concern_path(record)), class: "font-semibold text-[#07349e] underline" %>
                  </td>
                  
                </tr>
              <% end %>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      <% else %>
        <div class="rounded-md bg-[#f7f8fc] px-4 py-8 text-center text-xs text-slate-600">
          <% if active_filter == "documents" %>
            You haven't submitted any document application requests yet.
          <% elsif active_filter == "concerns" %>
            You haven't reported any community incident concerns yet.
          <% else %>
            You haven't submitted any document requests or reported concerns yet. Use the service cards above to get started.
          <% end %>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </section>
  </div>

  <footer class="bg-[#edf2ff] px-4 py-6 text-[9px] text-slate-600 sm:px-6 sm:py-7">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1140px] grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <section><h2 class="mb-2 font-bold text-slate-900">Barangay Kalikid Sur</h2><p>Accessible barangay services for registered residents. Use this digital civic desk to submit and track your document requests and community concerns.</p><p class="mt-2">For registration or service assistance, contact the Barangay Hall through its official channels.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="mb-2 font-bold text-slate-900">Resident Services</h2><p>Your submitted information helps the barangay process document requests and respond to community concerns. Please keep your profile and contact details up to date.</p><p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-emerald-700">Resident services and request tracking</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="mb-2 font-bold text-slate-900">Civic Operating Schedule</h2><div class="rounded-md bg-[#e2eaff] p-3"><p>Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM</p><p>Saturday: 8:00 AM - 12:00 PM</p><p class="font-semibold text-red-700">For emergencies, contact local emergency services.</p></div></section>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto mt-6 flex max-w-[1140px] flex-col justify-between gap-2 border-t border-[#d9e2f7] pt-3 text-[8px] sm:flex-row"><span>©<%= Date.current.year %> Barangay Kalikid Sur, Cabanatuan City, Nueva Ecija. All Rights Reserved.</span><span class="flex gap-4"><span>Resident Services</span><span>Citizens Charter</span><span>Privacy</span></span></div>
  </footer>
</div>
